{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3020021020010","name":"円香","text":"カフェ、あそこじゃない？","trans":"咖啡店，是不是那家？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020050","name":"透","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020060","name":"透","text":"いた\r\nカフェの前","trans":"在\n咖啡店门口","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020070","name":"透","text":"ドアのとこ","trans":"门那边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020080","name":"透","text":"ドーンって","trans":"咚地一下","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020090","name":"透","text":"黒い鳥が","trans":"一只黑鸟","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020100","name":"透","text":"お主、そこをどけー\r\nここをどこだと思っておるー","trans":"你这家伙，给我让开——\n你以为这里是什么地方——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020110","name":"円香","text":"……やめときな\r\n行こ","trans":"……算了吧\n走吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020120","name":"透","text":"え、お茶は？","trans":"诶，茶呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020130","name":"円香","text":"別にこの店じゃなくてもいいんじゃ──","trans":"又不是非得这家店——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-32","name":"カラス","text":"カーッカーッ！","trans":"嘎——嘎！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020140","name":"小糸","text":"よ、予定より早めに終わったね","trans":"比、比预定时间结束得早呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020170","name":"雛菜","text":"透先輩たち、先にお仕事終わったから\r\nカフェにいるって～","trans":"透前辈她们工作先结束了，\n说在咖啡店～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020180","name":"雛菜","text":"チェイン来てた～","trans":"Chain上来消息了～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020200","name":"小糸","text":"つ、次の打ち合わせまで、まだ時間あるもんね","trans":"离、离下次碰头还有时间嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020210","name":"雛菜","text":"『お仕事終わったからそっち向かうね』","trans":"“工作结束了，我这就过去哦”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020220","name":"円香","text":"『ごめん、違う店にした』","trans":"“抱歉，换了别的店”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020230","name":"円香","text":"『こっち来て』","trans":"“过来这边”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020260","name":"円香","text":"雛菜たち、こっち来るって","trans":"雏菜她们说要过来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020280","name":"透","text":"飛んでなかった","trans":"它没飞","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020290","name":"円香","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020300","name":"透","text":"あいつ\r\nさっきの","trans":"那家伙\n刚才那只","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020320","name":"透","text":"あそこにいた、振り返ったら","trans":"还在那儿，回头一看","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020330","name":"円香","text":"店の前？","trans":"店门口？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020350","name":"円香","text":"……\r\n飛ばないんかーい","trans":"……\n它怎么不飞啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020360","name":"透","text":"してたのかな、ケガとか","trans":"是不是受伤了呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020380","name":"透","text":"飛べない","trans":"飞不起来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020390","name":"透","text":"飛びたくても","trans":"就算想飞","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020400","name":"透","text":"羽があっても","trans":"就算有翅膀","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020410","name":"透","text":"いる\r\nそういうやつも","trans":"也有啊\n那样的家伙","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020420","name":"透","text":"まだしてるかな、通せんぼ","trans":"它还在挡路吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020430","name":"円香","text":"さすがにお店の人がなんとかしてるんじゃない","trans":"店里的人总该想办法处理了吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020450","name":"円香","text":"カラス？","trans":"乌鸦？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020460","name":"雛菜","text":"うん～……\r\n雛菜たちのところに急に飛んできた～","trans":"嗯～……\n它突然朝我们这边飞过来～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020470","name":"小糸","text":"そ、それで怖くて、ここまで走ってきて……","trans":"所、所以吓到了，就一直跑到这里……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020480","name":"透","text":"──来たのかも、助けに","trans":"——也许是来救它的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020510","name":"透","text":"大丈夫だね、もう","trans":"已经没事了吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020520","name":"透","text":"飛べ────","trans":"能飞了————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020530","name":"透","text":"飛んでいけ","trans":"飞吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020540","name":"透","text":"────ガシャン","trans":"————哗啦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020550","name":"透","text":"窓を割って","trans":"打破窗户","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020021020560","name":"off","text":"ほんとの世界に","trans":"奔向真实的世界","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}